WEBVTT

00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:16,660
Can I travel with the right machine? And if so, is it okay to be in the same house as a pregnant woman?

00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:23,620
Yes, you can travel with the right machine, just be very careful and wrap it up.

00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:28,820
Make sure you're very careful with the bulb. We've had a number of people

00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:36,820
send a bulb back, say, their bulb's not working and it's broken on the inside and the ends.

00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:47,380
If you drop these bulbs and it falls on a bed and it hits just wrong on its end, it will break the glass

00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:51,940
in there and it doesn't look like it's broken. You know, so you're looking at it. I don't see

00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:56,980
anything broken. I don't see anything wrong with it, but it doesn't work. And then you open it up

00:00:56,980 --> 00:01:03,060
on our side and it's broken. All the gas is gone. It's not going to work. So yeah, do you really,

00:01:03,060 --> 00:01:08,180
really careful with the bulbs. The machines are a little bit harder, but again, if you're dropping

00:01:08,180 --> 00:01:16,740
the machine or it's bonking through an airplane, you know, you could break it. It's a very delicate

00:01:16,740 --> 00:01:24,020
instrumentation on the inside. If you open up the machines, you can see how bonking this thing around

00:01:24,020 --> 00:01:29,620
these little tiny wires could break loose. We had somebody ship a machine back to us and there was

00:01:29,620 --> 00:01:34,740
multiple broken things though. I don't put all the fault on the person who shipped it back to us

00:01:34,740 --> 00:01:39,460
because it went back and forth with the post office and the box was damaged. So I don't know who stepped

00:01:39,460 --> 00:01:46,260
on it and who ran over with their truck. But when you open up the box, it was hardly wrapped. So part of it,

00:01:46,980 --> 00:01:51,540
the fault had to fall under that person who shipped it back to us. You have to wrap these things

00:01:51,540 --> 00:01:57,460
up really good. You have to be really careful with them. So by all means you can travel with your

00:01:57,460 --> 00:02:02,820
right machine. I've always traveled with my right machine and have had no problems, but I'm very

00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:08,900
careful how you wrap it up. Can you be in the house with the same house as a pregnant woman? Yes, you can.

